  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A toy car of mass 2 kg is at rest on a horizontal surface. A force of 30 N is applied to the toy car at time t = 0. Frictional forces of 10 N act on the toy car throughout its motion.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the speed of the toy car at t = 2 s?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">10 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">20 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">30 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">40 m s<sup>−1</sup></li></ol>"
  },
